# Licenses for this repository

Copyright (c) 2026 Jie Fu and Shihao Wang. Both authors hold the copyright
jointly and contributed equally.

This repository uses two licenses, according to the material's purpose:

- Original source programs, functions, and executable scripts are licensed
  under the MIT License. See [LICENSE-CODE](LICENSE-CODE).
- Saved computational results and records, generated data, catalogues, and
  explanatory documentation are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution
  4.0 International (CC BY 4.0). See [LICENSE-RESULTS](LICENSE-RESULTS).

For example, a GAP file whose purpose is to hold a saved family list or
relation data is a result file, not a source program merely because its
extension is `.g`. Conversely, source code embedded in a program file remains
under MIT. Third-party software and cited works are not relicensed here.

Both licenses allow reuse and redistribution, including modification and
commercial use. Retain the applicable license notice and credit Jie Fu and
Shihao Wang. For CC BY 4.0 material, also identify changes when sharing an
adaptation and link to the license. See [CITATION.cff](CITATION.cff) for the
recommended repository citation. A version-specific DOI should be used once
one has been assigned to a released archive.
